  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="6fcafa02-1282-5851-92d8-c28e4a8d5405" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Model a user directory, JWT identity and protected routes; enforce member ownership in code.&#10;Register once per subject; request-key replay returns the original identity.&#10;Members edit only their own permitted fields; staff own branch/status changes.&#10;Commit expected-version mutation, uniqueness marker, request key and history atomically; page at most 25 results.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
